                            <comment id="16552595" author="githubbot" created="Mon, 23 Jul 2018 10:15:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user dmekhanikov opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4403&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4403&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9009&quot; title=&quot;Local continuous query listeners may be called on partition reassignment&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9009&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9009&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Don&apos;t process backup updates for local continuous queries.&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/gridgain/apache-ignite&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/gridgain/apache-ignite&lt;/a&gt; ignite-9009&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4403.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4403.patch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To close this pull request, make a commit to your master/trunk branch&lt;br/&gt;
with (at least) the following in the commit message:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This closes #4403&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit c75df5c917646fa75b155afd0b79a0f26d809b45&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Denis Mekhanikov &amp;lt;dmekhanikov@...&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
